# Vitest runs in mode "test", so vite loads this file. Committed on purpose: without it the client
# suite depends on a developer's local .env and fails on a fresh clone and in CI, where src/client/env.ts
# throws on a missing key. Public placeholder — the client tests never reach Clerk (msw intercepts).
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_dGVzdC1zdWl0ZS5jbGVyay5hY2NvdW50cy5kZXYk
# Unset: the client suite drives the store directly, with no sync Worker.
VITE_SYNC_URL=
